Upstream package
----------------
CompQuadForm 1.4.4, "Distribution Function of Quadratic Forms in Normal Variables"
Date: 2025-07-13

Authors credited by the upstream DESCRIPTION:
  Pierre Lafaye De Micheaux
  Pierre Duchesne
  Robert B. Davies
  R. W. Farebrother
  J. Sheil
  I. O Muircheartaigh

Upstream license declaration: GPL (>= 2)

This repository is a modern Fortran translation of the computational portions
of that package. R loading/registration glue and other non-computational
package infrastructure are omitted.

Algorithm attribution
---------------------
Davies:
  Robert B. Davies (1980), "Algorithm AS 155: The Distribution of a Linear
  Combination of chi-squared Random Variables", Applied Statistics 29(3),
  323-333.

Farebrother/Ruben:
  Algorithm AS 204, Applied Statistics 33(3), 1984, based on the second part
  of Sheil and O'Muircheartaigh (1977), Algorithm AS 106, "The distribution
  of non-negative quadratic forms in normal variables", Applied Statistics
  26, 92-98.

Imhof:
  J. P. Imhof (1961), "Computing the Distribution of Quadratic Forms in
  Normal Variables", Biometrika 48(3/4), 419-426.

Liu approximation:
  The R implementation in CompQuadForm is translated directly. See the
  upstream package citation and documentation for the Liu-Tang-Zhang method.

The upstream package asks users to cite:
  Duchesne, P. and Lafaye De Micheaux, P. (2010), "Computing the distribution
  of quadratic forms: Further comparisons between the Liu-Tang-Zhang
  approximation and exact methods", Computational Statistics and Data
  Analysis 54, 858-862.

r_mod.f90
---------
The user supplied r_mod.f90 for reuse and identified it as MIT-licensed. The
same formatting-normalized copy used in the preceding translation is included.
No copyright-holder information was present in the supplied source, so none
has been invented.
